### FOR TESTING YOU NEED VSCODE EXTENTION "REST Client" from Huachao Mao

### GET ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/user HTTP/1.1



### GET USER BY ID
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/user/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer 


### CREATE MASTER USER SUPER 
POST http://localhost:4000/v1/user/master HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "kribo",
  "email": "kribo@scorpiocoding.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe01",
  "realm": "super"
}

