### UPDATE USER
PUT http://localhost:4000/v1/user HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
  "id": 7,
  "name": "caitlin",
  "email": "caitlin@scorpiocoding.com"
}


### DELETE USER
DELETE http://localhost:4000/v1/user HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
  "id": 2
}


